11:["$","li","Relationship details: what you call your partner, your relationship status and start date if you choose to add them, and who is in your space.",{"children":"Relationship details: what you call your partner, your relationship status and start date if you choose to add them, and who is in your space."}]
12:["$","li","What you create: messages, photos, videos and voice notes, memories, calendar events, daily answers, mood entries, diary entries, letters, lists, places, songs and bucket-list items.",{"children":"What you create: messages, photos, videos and voice notes, memories, calendar events, daily answers, mood entries, diary entries, letters, lists, places, songs and bucket-list items."}]
13:["$","li","Calls: that a call took place, between whom, when and for how long. Call audio and video pass through our calling provider and are not recorded or stored by us.",{"children":"Calls: that a call took place, between whom, when and for how long. Call audio and video pass through our calling provider and are not recorded or stored by us."}]
14:["$","li","Your device: a push-notification token, device type, operating system and app version.",{"children":"Your device: a push-notification token, device type, operating system and app version."}]
15:["$","li","Purchases: whether you have an active Klin Plus subscription. Payment details stay with Apple or Google; we never see your card.",{"children":"Purchases: whether you have an active Klin Plus subscription. Payment details stay with Apple or Google; we never see your card."}]
16:["$","li","Support: what you send us when you contact support or report something.",{"children":"Support: what you send us when you contact support or report something."}]
17:["$","li","Analytics and error reports, if you allow analytics (see below). These contain events such as screens visited, not the content of your messages or entries.",{"children":"Analytics and error reports, if you allow analytics (see below). These contain events such as screens visited, not the content of your messages or entries."}]
18:["$","section","use",{"id":"use","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Why we use it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","We use your data to provide Klin to you and your partner, keep it secure, send the notifications you ask for, handle subscriptions, answer support requests and meet legal obligations. [Legal bases to be confirmed by counsel, for example contract, legitimate interests, consent and legal obligation.] We do not sell your data and we do not use it for advertising.",{"children":"We use your data to provide Klin to you and your partner, keep it secure, send the notifications you ask for, handle subscriptions, answer support requests and meet legal obligations. [Legal bases to be confirmed by counsel, for example contract, legitimate interests, consent and legal obligation.] We do not sell your data and we do not use it for advertising."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
19:["$","section","who-sees",{"id":"who-sees","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Who can see what"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Only the two people in a space can open its shared messages, photos, memories, calendar, journals and letters.",{"children":"Only the two people in a space can open its shared messages, photos, memories, calendar, journals and letters."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-text-primary","children":[["$","li","Private diary entries, private mood notes and private calendar events are visible only to the person who wrote them.",{"children":"Private diary entries, private mood notes and private calendar events are visible only to the person who wrote them."}],["$","li","Your partner sees a daily answer only after you have answered, unless you choose to show it sooner.",{"children":"Your partner sees a daily answer only after you have answered, unless you choose to show it sooner."}],["$","li","A letter is visible to the recipient only once it has been delivered.",{"children":"A letter is visible to the recipient only once it has been delivered."}],["$","li","Klin staff use admin tools that show account and relationship details such as status and plan. They do not show message, diary, mood-note or letter content. If you report something, we see only what you choose to attach to the report.",{"children":"Klin staff use admin tools that show account and relationship details such as status and plan. They do not show message, diary, mood-note or letter content. If you report something, we see only what you choose to attach to the report."}]]}]]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","encryption",{"id":"encryption","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"How we protect it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Access to each space is restricted by database rules so one couple cannot reach another’s data, and media is served through short-lived private links.",{"children":"Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Access to each space is restricted by database rules so one couple cannot reach another’s data, and media is served through short-lived private links."}],["$","p","Klin is not end-to-end encrypted. That means our servers can process your content in order to run the app. If this changes we will say so here and in the app.",{"children":"Klin is not end-to-end encrypted. That means our servers can process your content in order to run the app. If this changes we will say so here and in the app."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","assistant",{"id":"assistant","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"The assistant"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","The assistant is optional and you can turn it off in Privacy settings. It starts with no access to your messages, diary or mood notes. It sees only what you type to it and what you explicitly choose to attach, and the app shows you what will be sent before you send it.",{"children":"The assistant is optional and you can turn it off in Privacy settings. It starts with no access to your messages, diary or mood notes. It sees only what you type to it and what you explicitly choose to attach, and the app shows you what will be sent before you send it."}],["$","p","Your request is sent through our servers to our AI provider, [AI provider], so it can reply. [Provider data-use terms to be confirmed, including whether content is used for training and how long it is kept.] Your conversations with the assistant are private to you and you can delete them at any time. The assistant is not a therapist and does not diagnose anything. If a conversation suggests you are in distress, it will point you to support.",{"children":"Your request is sent through our servers to our AI provider, [AI provider], so it can reply. [Provider data-use terms to be confirmed, including whether content is used for training and how long it is kept.] Your conversations with the assistant are private to you and you can delete them at any time. The assistant is not a therapist and does not diagnose anything. If a conversation suggests you are in distress, it will point you to support."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","analytics",{"id":"analytics","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Analytics and cookies"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","On this website we use analytics only if you say yes in the banner. We use PostHog, and we do not use advertising cookies or trackers. You can change your choice by clearing this site’s stored data in your browser.",{"children":"On this website we use analytics only if you say yes in the banner. We use PostHog, and we do not use advertising cookies or trackers. You can change your choice by clearing this site’s stored data in your browser."}],["$","p","In the app, we collect product analytics only with your consent, and we use error monitoring (Sentry) to fix crashes. Neither includes the content of your messages or entries.",{"children":"In the app, we collect product analytics only with your consent, and we use error monitoring (Sentry) to fix crashes. Neither includes the content of your messages or entries."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","providers",{"id":"providers","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Who we share data with"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","We use service providers (processors) to run Klin. They process data only on our instructions.",{"children":"We use service providers (processors) to run Klin. They process data only on our instructions."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-text-primary","children":[["$","li","Supabase: database, file storage and sign-in. [Region: to be confirmed.]",{"children":"Supabase: database, file storage and sign-in. [Region: to be confirmed.]"}],["$","li","LiveKit: voice and video calls.",{"children":"LiveKit: voice and video calls."}],["$","li","OpenAI: the assistant, only when you use it.",{"children":"OpenAI: the assistant, only when you use it."}],["$","li","RevenueCat, Apple and Google: subscriptions and payments.",{"children":"RevenueCat, Apple and Google: subscriptions and payments."}],["$","li","Expo: push notifications.",{"children":"Expo: push notifications."}],["$","li","Sentry: error monitoring. PostHog: analytics, with consent.",{"children":"Sentry: error monitoring. PostHog: analytics, with consent."}],["$","li","Vercel: website hosting.",{"children":"Vercel: website hosting."}],["$","li","[Email provider]: account and security emails.",{"children":"[Email provider]: account and security emails."}]]}]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","transfers",{"id":"transfers","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Transfers outside your country"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Some providers process data outside Nigeria and the European Economic Area. [Transfer safeguards, for example standard contractual clauses and NDPA transfer requirements, to be completed with counsel.]",{"children":"Some providers process data outside Nigeria and the European Economic Area. [Transfer safeguards, for example standard contractual clauses and NDPA transfer requirements, to be completed with counsel.]"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","retention",{"id":"retention","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"How long we keep it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","We keep your data while your account is open.",{"children":"We keep your data while your account is open."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-text-primary","children":[["$","li","Deleted messages and entries are removed from the app straight away and purged from our systems within 30 days.",{"children":"Deleted messages and entries are removed from the app straight away and purged from our systems within 30 days."}],["$","li","If you leave a space, shared content stays read-only for 30 days so you can export it, then it is deleted. [To be confirmed.]",{"children":"If you leave a space, shared content stays read-only for 30 days so you can export it, then it is deleted. [To be confirmed.]"}],["$","li","If you delete your account there is a 14 day period to change your mind, after which your personal data is deleted.",{"children":"If you delete your account there is a 14 day period to change your mind, after which your personal data is deleted."}],["$","li","Notifications are kept for 90 days, call records for 12 months, and support tickets for 24 months after they close.",{"children":"Notifications are kept for 90 days, call records for 12 months, and support tickets for 24 months after they close."}],["$","li","Records of administrative actions are kept for longer for accountability and contain no message content.",{"children":"Records of administrative actions are kept for longer for accountability and contain no message content."}]]}]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","rights",{"id":"rights","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Your rights"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act and, where it applies, the GDPR, you can ask to access your data, correct it, delete it, export it, restrict or object to how we use it, and withdraw consent at any time. Most of this you can do in the app (Profile, then Account). For anything else, contact [privacy contact email].",{"children":"Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act and, where it applies, the GDPR, you can ask to access your data, correct it, delete it, export it, restrict or object to how we use it, and withdraw consent at any time. Most of this you can do in the app (Profile, then Account). For anything else, contact [privacy contact email]."}],["$","p","You can complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission, or to your local data protection authority if you are in the EEA or UK.",{"children":"You can complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission, or to your local data protection authority if you are in the EEA or UK."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
21:["$","section","age",{"id":"age","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Age"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Klin is for people aged 18 and over. We ask for your date of birth when you sign up and do not create accounts for anyone younger.",{"children":"Klin is for people aged 18 and over. We ask for your date of birth when you sign up and do not create accounts for anyone younger."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
22:["$","section","changes",{"id":"changes","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Changes"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","If we change this policy in a way that matters, we will tell you in the app before it takes effect. The date at the top shows when it was last updated.",{"children":"If we change this policy in a way that matters, we will tell you in the app before it takes effect. The date at the top shows when it was last updated."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
